---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site, path } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy | ZAKIR DIGITAL"
  description="How this ZAKIR DIGITAL portfolio handles its local project-brief tools and external contact links."
>
  <article class="legal-page wrap">
    <a class="text-link" href={path()}>
      Back to the portfolio
    </a>
    <h1>Privacy, in plain language.</h1>
    <p>
      This page describes how this portfolio is implemented. It is not a legal certification.
      Updated 9 October 2026.
    </p>
    <h2>What this website does</h2>
    <p>
      This is a static portfolio with no accounts, database, analytics, advertising trackers or
      embedded external chatbot. Fonts and images are served locally. The support assistant example
      uses prewritten answers and has no free-text field.
    </p>
    <h2>Your project brief</h2>
    <p>
      The enquiry composer processes your name, business name, email, town or service area, website
      URL, service interest and message in your browser. The site does not submit this form to a
      server, store it in localStorage or send it to ZAKIR DIGITAL automatically. Please avoid
      sensitive information.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can copy the brief to your device’s clipboard or download it as a text file. These actions
      happen only when you choose them. Your browser may restore form values according to its own
      settings.
    </p>
    <h2>Email and WhatsApp drafts</h2>
    <p>
      Zakir will use the details you choose to send only to reply to your enquiry. This page has no
      direct “Send enquiry” integration.
    </p>
    <p>
      “Open email draft” passes your brief to your chosen email application using a mailto link.
      “Open WhatsApp draft” opens WhatsApp with the brief included in the destination URL. That step
      shares the message content with the application you open. Opening a draft does not send a
      message; you review and send it yourself.
    </p>
    <p>
      WhatsApp and your email provider have their own privacy practices. Direct contact links also
      open external services. Information you choose to send there is handled by those providers and
      received by Zakir through the chosen channel.
    </p>
    <h2>Fictional project demos</h2>
    <p>
      The three sample websites are concepts for fictional businesses. Their enquiry examples show
      local messages only. They do not collect personal details, submit forms or take bookings.
    </p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>
      This version is a local preview. If it is published later, the selected hosting provider may
      process ordinary request data such as IP addresses and access logs. The owner should review
      this page against the chosen hosting configuration before publication.
    </p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about this portfolio, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
